WEBVTT

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.640
This is the report 
on the kidnapping of Keith Claes.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.960
The one thought to be 
responsible, Thomas Coleman,

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.010
was found to be no more than a puppet.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:15.650
The true culprit was a woman named Sarah.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:19.950
She was controlling Thomas 
and the mansion's owner with dark magic.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.170
I believe she is probably involved 
with Marquis Dieke's family.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.800
That's the family Raphael 
brought charges against last year.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.620
But weren't all the people involved 
with dark magic captured?

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.800
That's what we thought,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.070
but Sarah knew too much about dark magic.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:42.510
I investigated further and discovered 
more crimes by the Dieke family.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:46.260
There were others among them 
who had been given dark magic,

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.240
aside from the man who used it on Raphael.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:53.120
And nearly all of them were orphans 
or purchased children.

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.770
They were referred 
to by numbers rather than names,

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:57.980
and they were used as research subjects.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:01.530
And they were all disposed 
of before the incident came to light.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:05.160
One of them was a young 
girl with black hair.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:08.680
That's quite the nauseating story.

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.950
If it's true, then this Sarah girl 
is another victim of the Dieke family.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.880
Why did she commit a crime like this?

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:19.350
We won't even have a chance 
at knowing until we catch her.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:21.120
I still have questions.

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:25.280
Why was Lady Catarina 
able to undo the dark magic?

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.690
Because of this.

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:31.270
A dark magic tool that 
Catarina bought during the trip.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:36.110
It seems to give one the ability 
to sense dark magic.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.880
That's impressive.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:42.640
And so is Lady Catarina 
for just happening to pick up such a thing.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.680
It's not something I would've 
even considered buying.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.250
You could say that she has 
keen intuition, in her own way.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.280
Lady Catarina truly is interesting.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.340
She even tamed a dark familiar, didn't she?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:02:02.360
Yes, but that gave us a good excuse 
to put her in the Department of Magic.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.980
I can't wait until she graduates.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:08.730
<b>Doom</b>

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:32.540
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:32.540
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:40.490
<b>Episode 12
My Graduation Ceremony Happened...</b>

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.780
Over the past two years,

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:41.020
we have had many 
experiences at this academy,

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.160
and we have learned many things.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:46.870
The days spent here with 
my friends and teachers

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:49.630
<i>Today, I, Catarina Claes, am finally 
graduating from the Magic Academy.</i>

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.630
will become treasured memories 
I will never forget.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:52.370
It has truly been an eventful two years.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:57.370
It's a bit sad to think that this 
is the end of our student life.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:00.640
All kinds of things 
happened during these years.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:04.140
All the footage in our memories 
is scenes of eating.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:07.760
I bet there'll be a lot of tasty food 
at the graduation party!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.640
I look forward to it.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.140
Steak, roast beef...

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.100
...and cake, and jelly...

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:17.440
What should I have?

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.840
There's still the party 
at the castle tonight, too.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:22.280
Try not to go overboard now.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.280
Y-You're right!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:28.230
I still can't believe 
we're already graduating.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.440
I know.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.530
It makes me remember how excited 
I was at the entrance ceremony

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:35.790
to know that I'd be sharing 
a dorm with Lady Catarina.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:39.900
I never thought I'd make any friends,

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:43.800
so I'm truly happy that I get to 
celebrate graduation with all of you.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.320
Me, too!

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.590
We went through a lot of crazy things,

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:51.230
but thanks to all of you, 
I really enjoyed my time at school!

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:53.760
I'll no longer be able to stay 
close to you all the time.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:55.480
It makes me worry about you.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.560
I never thought you'd enter 
the Department of Magic.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:01.390
It's under the pretext of making you 
the caretaker of that thing, right?

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.240
N-No, Spot! Go home!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.010
I know I keep saying this,

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.260
but it's only until we 
get married, remember?

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:14.120
Prince Geordo, Prince Alan.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.210
Congratulations on graduating.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.480
Master Keith, please accept this.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.210
Lady Mary!

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.430
Congratulations.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.070
Lady Sophia!

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:21.590
Thank you!

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:25.130
Wow, you're all so popular.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.850
Lady Catarina, 
I've always been a fan of yours.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.110
We'll continue to support you.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:31.100
Please take these.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.350
F-For me? Thanks!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:37.810
You are quite popular, 
as well, Lady Catarina.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:42.730
Not as much as the other members 
of the student council, though.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.910
There you go again.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:46.950
I'm sorry, Lady Catarina.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:50.160
Oh, it's fine. It's the truth, after all.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.980
This is from me.

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:53.730
Thanks, Frey!

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:57.340
H-Here.

00:05:57.610 --> 00:06:01.380
I thought you would like 
this far more than flowers.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:05.200
A bouquet not of flowers, but of sweets!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.590
I love it!

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:12.870
Ginger here spent a lot of time thinking 
about what would please you the most.

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:15.080
She scoured lots of sweets shops, too.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.110
Y-You don't need to tell her that!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.550
Really? Thanks!

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:23.460
By the way, are you two coming 
to the party at the castle tonight?

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:26.810
I'll be there, but Ginger...

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.290
I won't be attending.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:32.570
I don't have any dresses or accessories 
suitable to wear to the castle.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:36.830
I told her I'd lend her one 
of my dresses, but she refuses.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:39.370
Because our sizes are too different.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.750
I'll lend you one of my dresses, then!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.740
What? One of yours?

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:44.430
Yeah!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:46.680
But...

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:49.760
You get to borrow a dress 
from someone you admire so much.

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.760
You won't get another chance like this.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.980
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.360
Lady Catarina!

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.380
Me, too!

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:58.960
Please lend me a dress, too!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.570
What? Don't you have 
lots of dresses already?

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.790
That's one thing, and this is another!

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:06.650
No fair, Lady Mary! 
I want to borrow one, too!

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.480
I want to wear one 
of Lady Catarina's dresses!

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:12.160
Are they all on some 
kind of graduation high?

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:12.160
I want to wear one, too, Lady Catarina!

00:07:16.970 --> 00:07:18.950
Congratulations, Catarina.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.690
To think you actually get to graduate...

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.670
To be honest, I had given 
up on the possibility.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:28.650
Congratulations, truly. 
Please enjoy yourself today.

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.410
I will!

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:33.520
I am truly happy 
to see this day come, as well.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:37.020
It's all because you were 
with me, Anne. Thanks!

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.560
Lady Catarina...

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.320
Oh, good! It suits you well!

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:49.270
Thank you so much for doing this for me.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:51.770
I don't care how jealous the others get!

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:53.370
Don't mention it.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.870
<i>What does she mean by "jealous"?</i>

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:04.320
By the way, Lady Catarina, 
you brought quite a lot of luggage.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:07.210
Yeah, I brought pajamas 
and everything I need to spend the night.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.120
What?!

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.960
If you're spending the night at the castle, 
then you and Geordo finally...

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:14.840
They're having all of the student 
council members stay for the night.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.130
I'm going to have a girls' night in!

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:19.050
I see...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.580
<i>Ah, a party and a girls' night in!</i>

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.360
<i>I can't wait!</i>

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.910
The food they serve at the castle 
really is totally different!

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:38.620
Hi there, Lady Catarina.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.210
Prince Jeffrey! And you're all here, too!

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:47.530
Congratulations on 
graduating, Lady Catarina!

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:48.920
Th-Thanks...

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.710
I look forward to our 
continued relationship.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:56.550
Lady Catarina, I am truly grateful to you.

00:08:56.550 --> 00:09:02.380
If I had never met you... by now, I'd be...

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:03.600
Selena...

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.570
I'm happy for you, Lady Selena!

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:09.200
You and Prince Ian seem so close.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:13.010
That's all thanks to you, Catarina Claes.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:15.360
Huh? But I didn't...

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:19.940
Brothers, would you mind 
setting Catarina free now?

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:21.180
Yeah, okay.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:23.510
See you later, Lady Catarina.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:25.410
Do take care, Lady Catarina.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.310
I hope to see you again soon.

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:28.240
Sure!

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:35.350
Would you dance with me?

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:36.600
Okay.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:49.890
<i>He's the kind of beautiful, 
elegant prince that everyone admires.</i>

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:55.360
<i>And to think he would genuinely 
fall in love with someone like me...</i>

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.070
Is something wrong?

00:09:57.070 --> 00:10:00.410
Sorry. I was just thinking about something.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:03.680
Thinking about other things 
while you're dancing with me?

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.040
How sad.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:09.820
I wish you'd think only of me, 
at least right now.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:14.050
Prince Geordo.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.780
You have a guest waiting over there.

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:19.960
Very well.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.390
I'll be back as soon as I can.

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:27.310
Sister.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:29.440
Would you dance with me?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.440
Sure.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:35.610
Did Prince Geordo say 
something to you just now?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:36.980
What do you mean?

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.590
Well, like...

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:41.830
"Come to my room tonight," 
or "I'll come to get you."

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:46.410
I'm just worried that 
he might come after you.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.080
People are still trying to kill me?!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.120
I thought we were in the clear now!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:55.990
No, there's no way Prince Geordo 
would ever want to kill you.

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:59.210
Honestly, I don't understand 
your train of thought at all.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:05.090
When I say he might "come 
after you," I mean... well...

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.560
You know, like between a man and a woman.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.050
Between a man and a woman?

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:15.440
I wouldn't be surprised 
if he had that sort of thing in mind.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.520
What should I do, Keith?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:24.000
F-First of all, don't walk 
around outside your room alone.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.450
Don't let just anyone 
lure you out with sweets.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.480
Okay...

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:32.100
Catarina, would you dance with me?

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:34.720
Sure!

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:40.850
Congratulations on graduating.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.700
Thank you!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:46.090
By the way, I heard you had 
some arranged marriage meetings.

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:48.730
Yeah, but it didn't work out too well.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:53.230
<i>How could it not work out for someone 
as popular and charming as Nicol?</i>

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:57.370
Are arranged marriages actually 
a lot tougher than I thought?

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:59.780
Are there duels to formally decide 
whether you get engaged?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:02.090
No, nothing like that.

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.660
Huh? Did I say that out loud?

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:05.530
Yes?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.070
<i>I need to be more careful.</i>

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.250
<i>I wonder why it didn't work out, though...</i>

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:15.300
It was because I wasn't in any shape 
to settle on a life partner yet.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.470
Did I say that out loud again?

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:19.550
No, it was written on your face.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:20.590
Huh?!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.120
I'll have to make a decision eventually,

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:28.310
but right now... I'm not quite ready yet.

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:45.320
<i>No matter how many years go by, 
Nicol's devilish smile gets me every time.</i>

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:49.020
Hey, how much of that are you gonna take?

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:51.050
Don't you think that's a little too much?

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:52.410
Prince Alan!

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:54.340
Would you like to have some?

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.600
Nah, I'm worn out from greeting everyone.

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.380
I can't eat that much.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:03.030
But eating will give you your energy back.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.960
That only works for little kids and you.

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.670
Okay, I won't share with you, then!

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:15.730
<i>It's so good! This is just the best!</i>

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.760
Wh-What is it?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:32.570
What <i>is</i> it? You're just chowing down 
without a care in the world!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.190
Well, it's really good!

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:39.790
Here, try some, too! Open!

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:50.270
See? Delicious, isn't it?

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:52.270
Y-Yeah...

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:56.010
Lady Catarina! Please do that with me, too!

00:13:57.440 --> 00:13:59.360
Mary, are you okay?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:02.970
I-I'm fine. I'm just a bit hungry.

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.400
I'll get something for you, then.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.940
No, please, use that fork to give me...

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:09.740
No fair, Lady Mary! Do the same for me, too!

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.990
Okay, let's all eat together.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.120
Come in.

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.880
Keith, I came over to visit.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.520
S-Sister!

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:26.460
What's going on?

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.060
I'm on my way to our girls' night in,

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:31.380
but I wanted you to see my new pajamas.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:40.190
See? Look! Aren't they cute?

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:50.530
What? Are these pajamas too weird?

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.420
No, I think the pajamas are cute.

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:55.450
Really? Great!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.470
Listen, Sister...

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:00.990
I've already had 
the maid return to her room.

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:03.080
Oh, yeah, so I see.

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:07.540
So you and I are the only 
people in this room right now.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.280
You're right, we are.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.680
You don't get it at all.

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:23.600
It looks like you've forgotten me 
telling you how I feel about you.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.280
No, it's not that I forgot...

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:29.120
But afterward, 
you were acting totally normal,

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.950
so I thought maybe it was a dream...

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:35.750
I was just trying to act normal 
so you wouldn't feel uncomfortable.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.950
Thanks...

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:43.580
But if you think the feelings I finally managed 
to tell you about are just a dream,

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.750
I won't be that considerate anymore.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:46.920
Huh?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.440
Because I need you to be, 
at least, a little more aware of me.

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:53.280
You're just too defenseless.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:58.200
Didn't I tell you to be more careful?

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:02.010
If you walk into a man's room alone 
in your sleep clothes at night,

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:05.200
you can't complain 
no matter what he does to you.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.720
I can settle for just that,

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:18.120
but Prince Geordo might do 
something that can't be taken back.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:22.060
You should really try harder 
to realize that you're a woman.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:38.180
Lady Catarina?

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:39.430
Lady Catarina!

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.120
O-Oh... Mary?

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.650
Are you feeling unwell?

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:48.280
No, I'm fine. 
I guess I'm just a little tired.

00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:51.970
Well, our schedule was quite packed today.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:55.520
I've never attended a party 
at the castle before,

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:57.280
so it wore me out.

00:16:57.280 --> 00:17:01.170
I tried to behave 
the way you all taught me to,

00:17:01.170 --> 00:17:04.410
but I'm worried that I might 
have made lots of mistakes...

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:06.990
No, you were wonderful!

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:09.900
You did so perfectly, no one 
would know it was your first time.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:11.000
Uh-huh!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:13.780
I'm happy to hear you say that.

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:18.100
You had lots of people 
asking you to dance, too.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:22.420
But you didn't accept 
any of their invitations.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.400
What? Is that true, Maria?

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:28.750
Yes, I wasn't confident 
that I could dance correctly.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:33.110
But if someone really lovely asked you, 
couldn't you have tried it just once?

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.570
What kind of person is your type, Maria?

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:39.710
Someone who's always smiling, 
who shines like the sun.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:45.330
Also, someone who truly enjoys 
eating the sweets I make.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.170
I see!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:48.560
Me, too!

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.590
My type is also someone 
energetic and cheerful!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:54.200
I also prefer someone 
with brown hair and blue eyes!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:56.340
<i>That's oddly specific...</i>

00:17:56.340 --> 00:18:00.070
So, what sort of person do 
you prefer, Lady Catarina?

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:02.310
I guess...

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:06.700
I haven't thought about it 
in that much detail yet.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.270
What about you, Sophia?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.650
Me? Well, my type is...

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:14.350
The former prince of a lost nation,

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:16.250
or a thief who's on the side of justice,

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:18.840
or a childhood friend 
separated at a young age,

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:21.070
Sophia, those are all from books...

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:21.900
or the mischievous prince 
of a fairy kingdom...

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:26.040
Or a brave adventurer could be nice, too!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:36.970
Huh?

00:18:37.890 --> 00:18:39.830
This is...

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:47.230
I have to go tell her 
whenever I conquer a route.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:49.670
Acchan!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:53.100
Acchan! Acchan!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.400
Huh? Maria?

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.460
Which means this is...

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:12.800
I knew it! It's <i>Fortune Lover</i>!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.720
<b>Love at the Department of Magic</b>

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:19.950
Huh?!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:23.850
What is this? A different game 
from the one I played?

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:28.100
<b>Love at the Department of Magic</b>

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:28.110
Did it become so popular, they made a sequel?

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.100
Maria

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.100
<b>Today is our first day at the Department of Magic!</b>

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:32.360
I see!

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:34.930
It did say "Love at 
the Department of Magic."

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:38.400
I guess that means Maria meets 
more people at her new job.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:39.950
Hey, there's Sora!

00:19:40.390 --> 00:19:44.320
Is he one of the conquerable 
characters along with those other two?

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:51.240
Ah, there's that one again. 
That's totally Catarina.

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.260
Huh?! What did you say?!

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:55.770
Even after all she went through, 
she just never learns.

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.580
I swear, she's such a pest.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.750
Wh-What does this mean?! 
Why is Catarina there?!

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:04.490
She's just gonna torture me again, right?

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:08.270
I bet she'll get a punishment 
much worse than exile this time.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:11.690
What's a punishment worse than exile?!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.020
C'mon, give me a break!

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.510
You're making Catarina work way too hard!

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:20.250
Can't Catarina... Can't Catarina just...

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.620
...make her exit now?!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:25.670
Wh-What happened?

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:27.830
Lady Catarina, are you all right?

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.120
A dream?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:32.410
You must have had a scary dream 
because you're so tired.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:34.990
Please get plenty of rest.

00:20:34.990 --> 00:20:36.460
R-Right...

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:41.480
<i>That's right. It was just a dream.</i>

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:43.740
<i>All the doom flags are gone now.</i>

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.560
<i>There's nothing to worry about.</i>

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:56.820
It's time to say goodbye to this field, too.

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:59.440
Let's harvest lots 
of produce on this last day.

00:21:00.900 --> 00:21:02.780
Oh, those aren't ready yet.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:04.780
You should harvest these.

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:08.490
You've grown quite knowledgeable 
about this field, Anne.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:11.710
Yes, thanks to Lady Catarina.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:16.460
By the way, Lady Catarina, 
what will happen to this field now?

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:21.150
Oh, Ginger said she's 
going to take care of it.

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:24.920
I guess she's grown really fond of it.

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:28.560
I think it's you she's fond of, not the field.

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:31.230
You've seduced another one, Sister.

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:33.360
There are more and more of them.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:35.080
We can't fall behind.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:37.130
Let's keep working hard, Brother.

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:42.910
I've told you all over and over 
that Catarina is <i>my</i> fiancée.

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:48.920
Look, Lady Catarina! 
I picked such a big potato!

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:51.530
Wow, it really is!

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:57.830
<i>Just when I had avoided all my doom flags 
and advanced to my second year,</i>

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:01.660
<i>I got kidnapped, my brother 
Keith went missing...</i>

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:04.060
<i>All kinds of crazy things happened.</i>

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:08.800
<i>If I had been on my own, 
I doubt I could have overcome it all.</i>

00:22:09.130 --> 00:22:11.530
<i>I was only able to graduate</i>

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:15.810
<i>because of all my friends 
and the new acquaintances I made.</i>

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:20.520
<i>I hope I'll be able to spend my days smiling 
with all of them from now on.</i>

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:25.760
<i>And I hope I'll meet lots 
more amazing new people!</i>

00:22:30.440 --> 00:22:32.580
Congratulations on your acceptance 
into our department.

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:36.340
We've been waiting for you, 
Lady Catarina and Miss Maria.

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:40.090
We look forward to working 
with you, Raphael and Sora!

00:22:40.090 --> 00:22:41.910
Thank you for your guidance.

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:48.010
Okay, our seniors are going to 
show you around the department now.

00:22:58.950 --> 00:23:04.610
I'm Cyrus Lanchester, head of the 
Mana and Magic Research Section.

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:05.740
Nice to meet you.

00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:07.150
This is our newcomer...

00:23:07.150 --> 00:23:10.810
I'm Dewey Percy. Pleased to meet you.

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:12.970
You...

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:15.700
<b>Love at the Department of Magic</b>

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:16.250
You've gotta be kidding me!
